{
  "_comment": [
    "Authoritative artifact table for the ORT package configurations.",
    "Tarball hashes are the SHA-256 of the exact vcpkg source archives recorded in the",
    "2026-10-16 source audit (out/license-audit/source-evidence.json).",
    "The three header-only ports have no upstream archive: their artifact is a",
    "deterministic uncompressed tar bundle of the exact review headers (fixed PAX format,",
    "sorted members, mtime 0, uid/gid 0, empty uname/gname, mode 0644); the member names come from",
    "the real license-prepare producer, which preserves each raw vcpkg resource download",
    "filename (git-commit-prefixed), so the review header is bundled under that exact",
    "download name rather than the shortened name an earlier manual audit used. The",
    "header bytes are identical between the shortened and the real bundles, so the",
    "reviewed scan line matches are unchanged; only the member name and the resulting",
    "deterministic tar hash differ."
  ],
